Error: Jet.InvalidUnionMember: `T` can't be a union member
  --> Tests/UI/union_generic_open.jet:2:28
    |
  2 | choose: fn<T>(value: T) -> Int | T { value.copy() }
    |                            ^^^^^^^
 Why: Anonymous unions hold concrete closed types — not type parameters, trait objects, or function types
 Fix: Use a named enum when a member needs an open shape
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.InvalidUnionMember
